  "ruleText": "Rev 804.01 Homestead Rights. Homestead rights under RSA 480 shall not be a factor when determining whether a transfer is contractual or non-contractual.\n\nSource. #1175, eff 5-23-78; ss by #2154, eff 10-11-82; ss by #2822, eff 8-17-84; amd by INTERIM #4705, eff 11-21-89; ss by #5300, eff 12-26-91; ss by #6691, eff 2-21-98, EXPIRED: 2-21-06\n\nNew. #8579, eff 3-08-06; ss by #10665, eff 9-9-14; ss by 14071, eff 9-10-24",
